red_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","review_id":"H29jEMK2xlbyb11Oq8NyNQ","date":"2011-05-08T23:27:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375794529914856,"text_excerpt":"Kudos to the owners of Antoine's for opening Hermes early last year, not quite a locals bar but a place to go when you want to dress up (or not). Hermie's has great memorabilia on the walls about carnival and good mini plates of food. The place to get pommes souffle from Antoine's kitchen. Bar manager Mike is a Master Bartender and makes the best Sazerac's and old fashioned or anything else. He knows his craft well"},{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","review_id":"2NpB6ribIJIoCPapkr6spw","date":"2010-01-22T21:18:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9358292818069458,"text_excerpt":"Hermes Bar is the newly created bar (from the old Hermes dining room) at Antoine's Restaurant, est.1840. I think it's a long overdue move for this old line establishment to create a space for drinkers right off the street. The bar is fancy looking, but welcoming and there are a many pub style tables as well as the bar itself. The night I was there (with a dozen of my friends and friends of friends), fire was roaring in the fireplace (can't believe it actually functions!) which was very welcome on a chilly and damp NOLA night. The drinks were well made (with 1 exception) and I was pleased to see you can order ANYTHING from the regular menu at the bar. So some of my friends ordered cherries..."},{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","review_id":"UOE3nVoe23Q_twjivxGhxA","date":"2013-01-05T18:17:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9334390163421631,"text_excerpt":"This is a great little upscale bar which is part of Antoine's so you can order either off the limited bar menu or even off the full Antoine's menu if you want. The food is traditional and great - the gumbo is one of the best in the city and you can't go too wrong with most of the oyster preparations, including of course Rockefeller which was created by Antoine's many, many years ago. They have happy hour every day from 4-7pm which includes house wine and cocktails plus there's good music later on most Fridays and Saturdays. And the real reason to come to Hermes Bar is the cocktails which are truly some of the best in New Orleans. They're not necessarily the most cutting edge but the barte..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","photo_id":"iSXg9AjQBA8g0HIs-Pn52A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iSXg9AjQBA8g0HIs-Pn52A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8810338377952576},{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","photo_id":"PTiF1kFed9Kgz38aYviqqA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/PTiF1kFed9Kgz38aYviqqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8672743439674377},{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","photo_id":"7aBNPunN974YytWYkSrt9A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7aBNPunN974YytWYkSrt9A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8557542562484741},{"business_id":"3JOWaLAwQkYTZsgSe5HzVA","photo_id":"JFviS5IZ8voChHWoDITARQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JFviS5IZ8voChHWoDITARQ.jpg","visual_rep